#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:9
msgid "Backend Architecture"
msgstr "后端架构"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:12
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:14
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab supports multiple physics backends while presenting common asset, "
"sensor, and scene interfaces to environment code. Factories dispatch an "
"object to the active backend implementation at construction time, so code "
"can use the same public API without importing backend-specific modules "
"directly. For choosing a backend or preset in an environment, see "
":ref:`backends-and-presets`."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 支持多种物理后端，同时为环境代码提供统一的资源、传感器和场景接口。工厂在对象构造时选用当前后端的实现，因此代码可以使用相同的公共 "
"API，无需直接导入特定后端模块。环境中后端与预设的选择方法见 :ref:`backends-and-presets` 。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:22
msgid "Factory dispatch"
msgstr "工厂分派"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:24
msgid ""
"All factories inherit from "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.backend_utils.FactoryBase`. They locate supported "
"backend implementations through a core backend-key selector followed by "
"package and module-path conventions:"
msgstr ""
"所有工厂均继承 :class:`~isaaclab.utils.backend_utils.FactoryBase` "
"，先通过核心后端键选择器，再按照软件包和模块路径约定，定位受支持的后端实现："

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:28
msgid ""
"The name of ``SimulationContext.physics_manager`` is mapped to one of the "
"backend keys recognized by ``FactoryBase._get_backend()``. Adding another "
"physics backend requires extending this core selector."
msgstr ""
"``SimulationContext.physics_manager`` 的名称会映射到 ``FactoryBase._get_backend()``"
" 识别的某个后端键。添加新的物理后端时，需要扩展这个核心选择器。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:31
msgid ""
"The factory module path determines the backend module path. For example, "
"``isaaclab.assets.articulation`` maps to "
"``isaaclab_physx.assets.articulation``, "
"``isaaclab_newton.assets.articulation``, or "
"``isaaclab_ov.assets.articulation``. The OvPhysX backend key uses the shared"
" ``isaaclab_ov`` integration package."
msgstr ""
"工厂模块路径决定后端模块路径。例如， ``isaaclab.assets.articulation`` 映射到 "
"``isaaclab_physx.assets.articulation`` 、 "
"``isaaclab_newton.assets.articulation`` 或 "
"``isaaclab_ov.assets.articulation`` 。OvPhysX 后端键使用共享的 ``isaaclab_ov`` 集成软件包。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:37
msgid ""
"The factory lazily imports the backend module and caches the implementation "
"class in a registry."
msgstr "工厂按需导入后端模块，并将实现类缓存到注册表中。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:58
msgid ""
"Renderers and visualizers instead select their implementations through their"
" configuration's ``class_type``. Their selection is independent of physics; "
"renderer instances are shared through the simulation registry described "
"below."
msgstr "渲染器和可视化器则通过配置中的 ``class_type`` 选择实现。它们的选择独立于物理后端；渲染器实例通过下文介绍的仿真注册表共享。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:63
msgid "Physics manager lifecycle"
msgstr "物理管理器生命周期"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:65
msgid ""
"Each backend implements :class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysicsManager`, the "
"abstract base class that owns its simulation lifecycle. Implementations "
"initialize their engine from a :class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationContext`, "
"update kinematics with ``forward()``, advance simulation with ``step()``, "
"reset state with ``reset()``, and release resources with ``close()``."
msgstr ""
"各后端均实现 :class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysicsManager` 。这一抽象基类负责管理仿真生命周期。具体实现根据 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationContext` 初始化引擎，通过 ``forward()`` 更新运动学、 "
"``step()`` 推进仿真、 ``reset()`` 重置状态，并通过 ``close()`` 释放资源。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:71
msgid ""
"The manager exposes :class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysicsEvent` callbacks for "
"cross-backend lifecycle work. ``MODEL_INIT`` occurs during scene "
"construction, ``PHYSICS_READY`` after physics initialization, and ``STOP`` "
"before native resources are replaced or shut down. The concrete ``close()`` "
"implementation dispatches the ``STOP`` event."
msgstr ""
"管理器通过 :class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysicsEvent` 回调处理跨后端的生命周期操作。 ``MODEL_INIT``"
" 在场景构建期间触发， ``PHYSICS_READY`` 在物理初始化完成后触发， ``STOP`` 在原生资源被替换或关闭之前触发。具体的 "
"``close()`` 实现负责派发 ``STOP`` 事件。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:77
msgid ""
"``SimulationContext`` owns native resources and renderer instances in one "
"registry. ``get_or_create_backend(backend_cfg)`` reuses one resource for "
"equal configurations of the same concrete type; a cache miss constructs "
"``instantiate(backend_cfg)``. :class:`~isaaclab.sim.BackendCfg` describes "
"resource settings and identity, and :class:`~isaaclab.renderers.RendererCfg`"
" extends it for renderer instances. ``PhysicsCfg`` selects a physics "
"manager. Finalize configurations before registration and treat them, "
"including nested values, as read-only afterward. Use a new configuration for"
" different settings. ``close_backend(backend)`` closes the exact registered "
"object after all consumers have released their bindings; it does not compare"
" or hash configurations. Resources declared through ``BackendCfg`` must "
"implement ``close()``. Plain construction cfgs share Python-owned data "
"without a teardown operation; removing the registry entry releases its "
"reference. A failed close retains the entry for retry. After physics "
"shutdown invalidates camera render data, simulation teardown closes material"
" writers, renderer instances, visualizers, and remaining native resources, "
"in that order, before closing the stage."
msgstr ""
"``SimulationContext`` 在同一个注册表中持有原生资源和渲染器实例。对于具体类型相同、配置相等的对象， "
"``get_or_create_backend(backend_cfg)`` 会复用同一资源；缓存未命中时，通过 "
"``instantiate(backend_cfg)`` 创建资源。 :class:`~isaaclab.sim.BackendCfg` "
"描述资源设置和身份， :class:`~isaaclab.renderers.RendererCfg` 在此基础上描述渲染器实例， "
"``PhysicsCfg`` 则选择物理管理器。注册前应完成配置，注册后将配置及其嵌套值视为只读；需要不同设置时，应创建新配置。所有使用方释放绑定后， "
"``close_backend(backend)`` 会关闭那个确切的已注册对象，不会比较配置或计算其哈希。通过 ``BackendCfg`` "
"声明的资源必须实现 ``close()`` 。普通构造配置共享由 Python "
"管理的数据，没有显式关闭操作；移除注册表条目即可释放其引用。如果关闭失败，条目会保留以便重试。物理关闭使相机渲染数据失效后，仿真清理会依次关闭材质写入器、渲染器实例、可视化器和其余原生资源，最后关闭"
" USD 舞台。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:94
msgid ""
"Managers and native renderers expose their borrowed resource through "
"``backend``. For example, ``NewtonManager.backend.model`` accesses the "
"finalized native model. Closing a renderer releases its bindings, not the "
"shared native resource. Exposing native handles does not replace SDP "
"transport."
msgstr ""
"管理器和原生渲染器通过 ``backend`` 暴露借用的资源。例如， ``NewtonManager.backend.model`` "
"可访问最终构建完成的原生模型。关闭渲染器只会释放其绑定，不会关闭共享原生资源。暴露原生句柄并不替代 SDP 数据传输。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:99
msgid ""
"Clone contexts are registered separately as ``sim.clone_contexts[Context] = "
"Context(...)`` before plan dispatch. They apply the plan but do not own "
"native runtime resources."
msgstr ""
"克隆上下文在执行计划分派前，单独以 ``sim.clone_contexts[Context] = Context(...)`` "
"注册。它们负责应用计划，不持有原生运行时资源。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:102
msgid ""
"Newton has two resources with different lifetimes, not two interchangeable "
"backends:"
msgstr "Newton 有两类生命周期不同的资源，它们并非两个可互换的后端："

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:104
msgid ""
"``ModelBuilder`` holds mutable construction data. Cloning populates it and "
"sensors declare requirements before finalization. It remains available for "
"hard reset. ``NewtonBuilderCfg`` is a plain construction cfg, not a "
"``BackendCfg``; the builder needs no native ``close()``."
msgstr ""
"``ModelBuilder`` 持有可修改的构建数据。克隆时填充这些数据，传感器在模型最终构建完成之前声明需求；之后构建器仍保留，用于硬重置。 "
"``NewtonBuilderCfg`` 是普通构造配置，而不是 ``BackendCfg`` ，构建器无需原生 ``close()`` 操作。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:107
msgid ""
"``NewtonBackend`` owns the finalized model and native buffers. Physics and "
"render consumers borrow those handles. Closing it releases runtime "
"allocations without closing the builder."
msgstr ""
"``NewtonBackend`` 持有最终构建完成的模型和原生缓冲区，物理与渲染使用方借用这些句柄。关闭它会释放运行时分配的资源，但不会关闭构建器。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:110
msgid "Both resources use the same registry:"
msgstr "两类资源使用相同的注册表："

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:120
msgid ""
"Both configurations use the selected physics cfg; non-Newton physics selects"
" a render-only representation. ``SimulationContext`` has no backend-specific"
" cfg fields, and consumers do not access clone contexts. Consumers request "
"body transforms and visual points directly through SDP. Queries share the "
"native resource's BVHs but keep each consumer's captured work separate."
msgstr ""
"两种配置均使用选定的物理配置；物理后端不是 Newton 时，则选用仅用于渲染的表示。 ``SimulationContext`` "
"没有特定后端专用的配置字段，使用方也不访问克隆上下文，而是直接通过 SDP 请求刚体变换和可视点。查询共享原生资源的 "
"BVH，但各使用方捕获的计算工作相互独立。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:126
msgid "Portable asset and sensor interfaces"
msgstr "可跨后端使用的资源与传感器接口"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:128
msgid "Assets and sensors use the same layering as the factories:"
msgstr "资源和传感器采用与工厂相同的分层方式："

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:130
msgid ""
"A base class in ``isaaclab`` defines the public contract, such as "
"``BaseArticulation`` or ``BaseContactSensor``."
msgstr ""
"``isaaclab`` 中的基类定义公共接口约定，例如 ``BaseArticulation`` 或 ``BaseContactSensor`` 。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:132
msgid ""
"A factory class inherits from both :class:`FactoryBase "
"<isaaclab.utils.backend_utils.FactoryBase>` and that base class."
msgstr ""
"工厂类同时继承 :class:`FactoryBase <isaaclab.utils.backend_utils.FactoryBase>` "
"和相应基类。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:134
msgid "Backend packages provide the supported implementations."
msgstr "后端软件包提供受支持的具体实现。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:136
msgid ""
"Data classes use the same pattern, for example "
"``ArticulationData(FactoryBase, BaseArticulationData)``. Implementations "
"expose :class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` values through public asset "
"and sensor data properties. Each proxy wraps the underlying ``wp.array`` and"
" provides explicit ``.warp`` access to that array and cached, zero-copy "
"``.torch`` access to a :class:`torch.Tensor` view. Use those accessors when "
"an API specifically requires one representation. Passing a ``ProxyArray`` to"
" ``wp.to_torch()`` is supported only by a deprecated compatibility shim; new"
" code should use ``proxy_array.torch``. Backend-native and internal storage "
"may still use raw Warp arrays. See :doc:`/source/how-to/proxy_array` for "
"usage and buffer lifetime guidance."
msgstr ""
"数据类也采用相同模式，例如 ``ArticulationData(FactoryBase, BaseArticulationData)`` "
"。实现通过公共资源和传感器数据属性暴露 :class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` 。每个代理包装底层 "
"``wp.array`` ，通过 ``.warp`` 显式访问该数组，并通过 ``.torch`` 以缓存、零拷贝方式访问 "
":class:`torch.Tensor` 视图。当某个 API 明确要求特定表示时，请使用对应访问器。将 ``ProxyArray`` 传给 "
"``wp.to_torch()`` 仅由已弃用的兼容层支持，新代码应使用 ``proxy_array.torch`` "
"。后端原生数据和内部存储仍可能使用原始 Warp 数组。用法与缓冲区生命周期说明见 :doc:`/source/how-to/proxy_array` "
"。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:149
msgid "Portable renderer and scene-data interfaces"
msgstr "可跨后端使用的渲染器与场景数据接口"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:151
msgid ""
"Rendering is selected independently from physics. Acquire implementations of"
" the :class:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer` contract through "
"``sim.get_or_create_backend(renderer_cfg)``. The "
":class:`~isaaclab.renderers.RenderContext` coordinates their rendering "
"lifecycle through a filtered view of that registry, without a separate "
"renderer cache or renderer ownership. It validates global settings and "
"registration timing, initializes renderers after physics is ready, and "
"coordinates stage preparation, scene updates, and material writers. See "
":ref:`overview_renderers` for renderer choices and usage."
msgstr ""
"渲染器的选择独立于物理后端。通过 ``sim.get_or_create_backend(renderer_cfg)`` 获取符合 "
":class:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer` 接口约定的实现。 "
":class:`~isaaclab.renderers.RenderContext` "
"通过注册表的过滤视图协调渲染生命周期，不另设渲染器缓存，也不持有渲染器所有权。它验证全局设置和注册时机，在物理就绪后初始化渲染器，并协调 USD "
"舞台准备、场景更新和材质写入器。渲染器选择与用法见 :ref:`overview_renderers` 。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:161
msgid ""
"Physics managers expose live simulation data through "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataBackend`. The "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataProvider` owned by the simulation "
"context converts and remaps that data for backend-independent consumers:"
msgstr ""
"物理管理器通过 :class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataBackend` 暴露实时仿真数据。仿真上下文持有的 "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataProvider` 负责转换和重新映射数据，供不依赖具体后端的使用方消费："

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:170
msgid ""
"This boundary lets renderers and visualizers consume a common Warp-native "
"data path without knowing which physics engine owns the state. See "
":doc:`/source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers` for the complete data-"
"flow model."
msgstr ""
"通过这一接口边界，渲染器和可视化器可以使用统一的 Warp 原生数据路径，无需知道状态由哪个物理引擎持有。完整的数据流模型见 "
":doc:`/source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers` 。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:176
msgid "Native engine access boundary"
msgstr "原生引擎访问边界"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:178
msgid ""
"The portable interfaces define the stable API boundary. Advanced code can "
"use each engine's native low-level data API, but those APIs intentionally "
"keep their own ownership and synchronization semantics. See "
":doc:`/source/concepts/native-physics-api/index` for PhysX typed views, "
"Newton live model/state arrays and generic selections, and OvPhysX tensor "
"bindings."
msgstr ""
"可跨后端使用的接口构成稳定的 API 边界。高级代码可以使用各引擎的原生底层数据 API，但这些 API 保留各自的所有权和同步语义。PhysX "
"类型化视图、Newton 实时模型与状态数组及通用选择，以及 OvPhysX 张量绑定，见 :doc:`/source/concepts/native-"
"physics-api/index` 。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:186
msgid "Design principles"
msgstr "设计原则"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:188
msgid ""
"**Lazy loading:** Backend modules are imported only when first instantiated,"
" keeping startup fast and avoiding dependencies on unused backends."
msgstr "**按需加载：** 后端模块仅在首次实例化时导入，既加快启动，也避免依赖未使用的后端。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:190
msgid ""
"**Recognized keys plus convention:** Once the core selector recognizes a "
"backend key, module paths mirror the ``isaaclab.X.Y`` structure. OvPhysX "
"maps to ``isaaclab_ov.X.Y``; other recognized backends use "
"``isaaclab_<backend>.X.Y`` by default."
msgstr ""
"**已识别的后端键与路径约定：** 核心选择器识别后端键后，模块路径遵循 ``isaaclab.X.Y`` 的结构。OvPhysX 映射为 "
"``isaaclab_ov.X.Y`` ；其他已识别后端默认使用 ``isaaclab_<backend>.X.Y`` 。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:194
msgid ""
"**Independent selection:** Physics backend, renderer, and visualizer are "
"selected independently."
msgstr "**独立选择：** 物理后端、渲染器和可视化器分别选择。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:196
msgid ""
"**Explicit data interop:** Public asset and sensor data properties return "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray`; its ``.warp`` and ``.torch`` "
"accessors expose the required array representation without copying."
msgstr ""
"**显式数据互操作：** 公共资源和传感器数据属性返回 :class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` ；通过 "
"``.warp`` 和 ``.torch`` 访问所需的数组表示，无需复制。"

#: source/concepts/backend_architecture.rst:199
msgid ""
"**Zero runtime overhead:** Selection occurs at instantiation time; it does "
"not add dispatch logic to the simulation hot path."
msgstr "**无运行时额外开销：** 实现在实例化时选定，不会在仿真频繁执行的路径中增加分派逻辑。"
